Edukasaun-Dark is the Orchis GTK theme (https://github.com/vinceliuice/Orchis-theme,
teal accent, dark colors, standard size) by vinceliuice, built with its install.sh
and renamed for Edukasaun OS. Licensed under the GNU GPL version 3 (see COPYING).
The openbox-3 theme was written for Edukasaun OS with the same colors.
